 "name_en": "Classification for Customs Tariff Number and Commodity Code (2U3)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Classification for Customs Tariff Number and Commodity Code (2U3)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio7828b18cc8134cf6830b0699ccacfb46\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7828b18cc8134cf6830b0699ccacfb46__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item provides the business processes to maintain tariff codes and commodity codes. The defined codes can be assigned to products for proper classification.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7828b18cc8134cf6830b0699ccacfb46__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Load commodity codes from an external data provider</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage customs tariff numbers</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Classify or reclassify products with customs tariff numbers</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7828b18cc8134cf6830b0699ccacfb46__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Help to ensure accurate product classification for customs processes</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Keep international trade processes frictionless</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>关税号和商品代码分类 (2U3)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio7828b18cc8134cf6830b0699ccacfb46\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7828b18cc8134cf6830b0699ccacfb46__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目提供维护关税代码和商品代码的业务流程。可以将定义的代码分配给产品以进行正确分类。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7828b18cc8134cf6830b0699ccacfb46__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">从外部数据提供者加载商品代码</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">管理关税编号</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用关税编号对产品进行分类或重新分类</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7828b18cc8134cf6830b0699ccacfb46__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">有助于确保海关流程的准确产品分类</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">保持国际贸易流程顺畅</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
